{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54421","headline":"秋日再经盱眙县寄李长官 · 崔致远","name":"秋日再经盱眙县寄李长官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤蓬再此接恩辉，吟对秋风怅有违。\n门柳己凋新岁叶，旅人犹着去年衣。\n路迷霄汉愁中老，家隔烟波梦里归。\n自叹身如春社燕，画梁高处又来飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}